{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01031","headline":"相和歌辞 公无渡河 · 王叡","name":"相和歌辞 公无渡河","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"浊波洋洋兮凝晓雾，公无渡河兮公苦渡。\n风号水激兮呼不闻，提壶看入兮中流去。\n浪摆衣裳兮随步没，沈屍深入兮蛟螭窟。\n蛟螭尽醉兮君血乾，推出黄沙兮泛君骨。\n当时君死妾何适？遂就波澜合魂魄。\n愿持精卫衔石心，穷取河源塞泉脉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王叡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01031.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01031","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}